  "title": "SynCLIP: Synonym-Coherent Language-Image Pretraining for Robust Open-Vocabulary Dense Perception",
  "summary": "SynCLIP addresses synonym-induced grounding inconsistency in open-vocabulary dense perception by enhancing spatial attention consistency and improving grounding robustness. It introduces a Semantic-consistent Spatial Attention alignment (SSA) module and a Spatial Attention Refinement (SAR) module to refine spatial regions for more precise grounding.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "SynCLIP improves grounding consistency under diverse linguistic variants by minimizing discrepancies between attention maps of original and synonymous expressions.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Extensive experiments demonstrate that SynCLIP achieves state-of-the-art performance among CLIP-based OVDP methods.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The framework introduces a Semantic-consistent Spatial Attention alignment (SSA) module to enhance spatial attention consistency.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
